## §7 Verdict

**PARTIALLY CAPTURED — IDENTICAL FAILURE MODE AS CLIENT**. GC.Alloc baseline clean and usable (HOST 300 b/fr steady-state). Replicate-tick-timing baseline **INVALID** on HOST for the same reason as CLIENT: custom ProfilerMarker not sampled without active Profiler state.

Key finding: **M3 (HOST-only bypass) is invalidated** — HOST Dev Build blocked identically. Reviewer must pick **M1 (Profiler on, re-capture)** or **M2 (Stopwatch, follow-up PR)**. M2 recommended.

